        "metadata": {
          "media": {
            "duration": 1125,
            "fileSize": 18206596
          },
          "description": "Whiskers the cat is always on alert. In this spooky-funny audio series for ages 4–10, kids follow Whiskers as he uncovers oddities around the house, from sneaky snack swaps to the suspicious behavior of a humming robot vacuum. Each case is narrated by Whiskers himself, blending humor, mystery, and feline overconfidence. With just the right amount of eerie tension, this series invites kids into the curious mind of a cat convinced something strange is going on… ",
